---
// A numbered figure in a walkthrough. The illustration goes in the default slot; the caption is article
// text written in the MDX file (Markdown and math allowed) and passed in the "caption" slot:
//   <Figure>
//     <SomeIllustration />
//     <span slot="caption">What the reader should see, with $math$ if needed.</span>
//   </Figure>
// Numbers ("Figure 1.", "Figure 2.", …) come from a CSS counter on the article body.
---
<figure class="wt-figure">
  <slot />
  <figcaption class="wt-caption"><slot name="caption" /></figcaption>
</figure>
